{"schema":"mcpgit.table-batch-transaction.v1","transaction_id":"5171bcfb-c2ab-576d-b225-02e5f00b0a93","idempotency_key":"5171bcfb-c2ab-576d-b225-02e5f00b0a93","actor":{"kind":"github-action","repository":"yxsicd/agentlabrelease","runId":"36536561655","runUrl":"https://github.com/yxsicd/agentlabrelease/actions/runs/36536561655"},"recorded_at_unix_ms":1790667515252,"tables":[{"path":"program_facts","operations":[{"op":"insert","operation_id":"34bacc6f-2312-5d14-ad07-a07d107ff58a","key":"agent-analysis-appscope-identity-and-localized-app-strings","row":{"id":"agent-analysis-appscope-identity-and-localized-app-strings","kind":"analysis","payload":{"agentProposal":{"automaticPromotion":false,"schema":"agentlab.maintainer_skill_fact_proposal.v1","sourceAssessmentSha256":"1e40de782e5c8894a5666a23771e58d39cd6a13f5b30c054a912b7694276b619"},"dimensions":["boundary","relations","responsibility"],"evidence":[{"gitBlobOid":"20a7cb8ad618125d312058f48e360aca2adfbf9b","path":"AppScope/app.json5"},{"gitBlobOid":"4b6910087c23f01bc5797c216a8d28935fd870e1","path":"AppScope/resources/base/element/string.json"},{"gitBlobOid":"84cd0bd2d8bf1a3a87b0c8aa59b43ef0ec0ead5d","path":"AppScope/resources/en_US/element/string.json"},{"gitBlobOid":"ab180cdfef55bcd5248e3aef53bad8d621a6443a","path":"AppScope/resources/base/media/hmos_layered_image.json"}],"id":"agent-analysis-appscope-identity-and-localized-app-strings","interpretation":"AppScope is the application-level identity leaf of this HarmonyOS project: 8 tracked files, no ETS source, and no build or test entrypoints. Boundary: AppScope/app.json5 declares package identity (bundleName com.huawei.hmos.sample, vendor example, versionCode 1000000, versionName 1.0.0) and references only resources; base, en_US, and zh_CN resource trees plus three media PNGs complete the leaf. Relations: app.json5 binds label to $string:hmos_app_name, defined identically by name in base/element/string.json and both locale string.json variants, and binds icon to $media:hmos_layered_image, whose layered-image JSON binds background/foreground to the ic_background and ic_foreground PNGs; the root build-profile.json5 defines products but contains no AppScope-specific section, so AppScope config is not product-parameterized. Maintenance contract: keep the three string.json files name-aligned (hmos_app_name, internet_reason, network_reason, vibrator_reason), keep every $media/$string reference resolvable to an existing resource name, and change bundleName or version values only deliberately because they fix app identity across all locales.","kind":"analysis","limitations":["A repo-wide text search at this revision finds internet_reason, network_reason, and vibrator_reason only in the three AppScope string.json files; whether module manifests or build tooling actually consume these permission-justification strings, or whether they are dead entries, is unproved.","ic_start_icon_800.png has no referencing JSON, manifest, or source file among the inspected configuration; whether it is consumed at all (e.g., by app-store metadata) is unproved.","No build, packaging, signing, or resource compilation was executed; correctness of the layered-image PNG dimensions and the distributability of the bundleName/versionCode values is unproved."],"repositoryId":"code-workshop","scopeSkillIds":["skill-scope-code-workshop-appscope"],"sourceRevision":"7aa95cac4eca15e39fc6638cdf1de7db6fb70ad6"},"payloadSha256":"35e5534ffb8fda217f53177dad873bbdb120fd3a738ac6ab578214b69eb1c0d9","repositoryId":"code-workshop","sourceRevision":"7aa95cac4eca15e39fc6638cdf1de7db6fb70ad6"}},{"op":"insert","operation_id":"48fa10f6-b696-5045-b900-a4d671bc1d38","key":"agent-analysis-hvigor-build-engine-config","row":{"id":"agent-analysis-hvigor-build-engine-config","kind":"analysis","payload":{"agentProposal":{"automaticPromotion":false,"schema":"agentlab.maintainer_skill_fact_proposal.v1","sourceAssessmentSha256":"8fbda7e0b1116bf0af0165eda5b6da18b4574e05e2f0c51fd6c7aa0f97ec8aae"},"dimensions":["boundary","relations","responsibility"],"evidence":[{"gitBlobOid":"c8bc80925dedf78ebb304fa84b5f55dc2e28a640","path":"hvigor/hvigor-config.json5"},{"gitBlobOid":"f0c6ce4e0a91eb9cb7a8a1739cdc2b87eda102c5","path":"hvigorfile.ts"},{"gitBlobOid":"22aedaae91f857a8d991e13fcc98ddea7cb9ddf2","path":"oh-package.json5"}],"id":"agent-analysis-hvigor-build-engine-config","interpretation":"Maintenance contract (configuration-asset): hvigor/ is a single-file leaf boundary holding hvigor/hvigor-config.json5, the project-level config of the Hvigor build engine. Responsibility: pin engine modelVersion 5.0.0 and tune engine behavior via declared 'properties' that disable the in-memory cache (hvigor.enableMemoryCache=false, hvigor.pool.cache.capacity=0) and cap pool/ArkCompile concurrency (hvigor.pool.maxSize=5, ohos.arkCompile.maxSize=3); execution, logging, debugging, and nodeOptions blocks are fully commented, so documented defaults apply. Relations: no source imports this file; it is consumed by the Hvigor engine selected by root hvigorfile.ts via '@ohos/hvigor-ohos-plugin' (appTasks), its modelVersion should stay aligned with oh-package.json5 (5.0.0), and the engine acts on products declared in root build-profile.json5. Maintenance rules: keep the file valid JSON5, do not rename existing property keys, bump modelVersion only together with oh-package.json5, and treat uncommenting knobs as deliberate engine behavior changes. No build execution or tool behavior is claimed.","kind":"analysis","limitations":["Whether the Hvigor engine at modelVersion 5.0.0 actually honors the four 'properties' keys (hvigor.pool.cache.capacity, hvigor.pool.maxSize, ohos.arkCompile.maxSize, hvigor.enableMemoryCache) is unproved: the repo contains no engine source or documentation for them.","The inline comments stating defaults for execution, logging, debugging, and nodeOptions options are unverified vendor annotations; the effective defaults at the pinned engine version were not observed.","No evidence that a build consuming this configuration succeeds, nor that the memory-tuning values are appropriate for any particular build machine; only textual alignment of modelVersion with oh-package.json5 was checked.","The relationship of this project-level config to any user- or CI-level hvigor settings that could override it was not examined."],"repositoryId":"code-workshop","scopeSkillIds":["skill-scope-code-workshop-hvigor"],"sourceRevision":"7aa95cac4eca15e39fc6638cdf1de7db6fb70ad6"},"payloadSha256":"d274021ad0932e3746187332465b6fa10a42510aa2663418525f8405d13fbe15","repositoryId":"code-workshop","sourceRevision":"7aa95cac4eca15e39fc6638cdf1de7db6fb70ad6"}},{"op":"insert","operation_id":"c63c7690-d2b1-524c-a4a3-5301996c651d","key":"agent-analysis-multi-product-build-manifest-contract","row":{"id":"agent-analysis-multi-product-build-manifest-contract","kind":"analysis","payload":{"agentProposal":{"automaticPromotion":false,"schema":"agentlab.maintainer_skill_fact_proposal.v1","sourceAssessmentSha256":"e316df77fefac67b13138c4b58da7f43426755810a140500f3b7d7a0b46e1cbd"},"dimensions":["behavior","boundary","relations","responsibility"],"evidence":[{"gitBlobOid":"03ada1b33bb56a68ee5243c459638fe3154523c5","path":"build-profile.json5"},{"gitBlobOid":"22aedaae91f857a8d991e13fcc98ddea7cb9ddf2","path":"oh-package.json5"},{"gitBlobOid":"f0c6ce4e0a91eb9cb7a8a1739cdc2b87eda102c5","path":"hvigorfile.ts"},{"gitBlobOid":"91592bc11e0239648befcb1c9f1b12415630d147","path":"VersionFile.json5"},{"gitBlobOid":"ccae3eeb477120f8b5d46eb018dcaadc9c6cd80a","path":"OAT.xml"}],"id":"agent-analysis-multi-product-build-manifest-contract","interpretation":"Root contract of the HMOS Code Workshop multi-product HarmonyOS app. Behavior: build-profile.json5, the declared build entrypoint, registers 13 modules (products phone, wearable, tv, pc; feature libraries mine, exploration, componentlibrary, devpractices, commonbusiness, widgetcommon, abilitycommon; shared common) across 7 flavors (default, dev, uat, uat_mirror, icsl, beta, prod), all at compatibleSdkVersion 6.1.0(23)/targetSdkVersion 6.1.1(24) with useNormalizedOHMUrl. oh-package.json5 sets modelVersion 5.0.0 and routes @ohos/hypium and @ohos/hamock versions via parameterFile VersionFile.json5; hvigorfile.ts binds the root build to @ohos/hvigor-ohos-plugin appTasks. Boundary: scope owns only the 9 root files (manifests, .gitignore, LICENSE, OAT.xml, bilingual READMEs); module sources and assets under products/, features/, common/, hmosword-build/, hvigor/, AppScope/ are sibling scopes referenced via modules[].srcPath. Relations: product targets bind module targets via applyToProducts; VersionFile.json5 parameterizes tool versions. Responsibility: keep module registry, flavor matrix, version parameterization, and compliance/docs files consistent as modules or SDK versions change.","kind":"analysis","limitations":["No build was executed, so it is unproved that the 13 declared modules resolve, that hvigor completes, or that the empty signingConfigs yield signable artifacts.","It is assumed, not verified, that every module-level oh-package.json5 resolves the @param:dependencies placeholders (hypium-version, hamock-version, imageknife-version) declared in VersionFile.json5.","Whether each modules[].srcPath directory actually exists with a valid module configuration was not inspected beyond the root manifest.","README-documented capabilities (1+8 device coverage, one-click sample sharing, app-store distribution) are claims from documentation, not verified runtime or release behavior."],"repositoryId":"code-workshop","scopeSkillIds":["skill-scope-code-workshop-root"],"sourceRevision":"7aa95cac4eca15e39fc6638cdf1de7db6fb70ad6"},"payloadSha256":"607cc581091c87d9aacd2e16e17a56c8ef90c3bc6b5e24b205ad11196940a76e","repositoryId":"code-workshop","sourceRevision":"7aa95cac4eca15e39fc6638cdf1de7db6fb70ad6"}}],"results":[{"operation_id":"34bacc6f-2312-5d14-ad07-a07d107ff58a","op":"insert","key":"agent-analysis-a